<title>UK: John Mansfield in talks for equity injection.</title>
<headline>John Mansfield in talks for equity injection.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Mansfield Group Plc, noting the sharp rise in its stock price, said on Thursday it was in the early stage of talks that could lead to a substantial injection of equity capital.</p>
<p>The timber products maker did not give more details, but added that it would make a further announcement in due course.</p>
<p>John Mansfield's stock shot up nearly 30 percent, rising 1.25p to 5.75 by 1130 GMT to rank as the top percentage gainer on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
